xlength	integer character count 
-find : index or -1
-split truncates the orginal at index, returns the portion truncated
-append	concatenate two strings
-insert	prepend a string to another
-words / split split on whitespace to T_LIST of mstrings
-join	list of mstring -> one mstring, separator optional.

help() and compiler command line 
means language command line handling
diagnose()
- diagnose(severity, area, line, col, fmt, \ldots) — errors always
  print and increment a count; debug prints only if the area bit is set.
  yyerror and the runtime “undefined” paths call it.  main returns
  non-zero if the count is non-zero. One exit point.  Optional: print the
  offending line with a caret. Column can wait if you do not have it yet.

recursion stack checker segfault fix
	:A depth counter or a SIGSEGV handler via
	sigaction that turns the overflow into a diagnose and a clean exit

